282	     * two digits of the fiscal year's starting calendar year. For example a date on or after 1 July
283	     * 2026 yields {@code 'FY26'}. The fiscal year starts on 1 July.
284	     *
285	     * @param date the date to classify, which for an owner is the business-day-adjusted registration date
286	     * @return the fiscal year label, e.g. {@code 'FY26'}
287	     */
288	    public static String fiscalYearLabel(LocalDate date) {
289	        return String.format("FY%02d", fiscalYearNumber(date) % 100);
